{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1526959-2e-larp-rules-question","id":1526959,"title":"2e LARP Rules question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-12-16T19:52:05-08:00","id":1526959,"title":"2e LARP Rules question","content":"I'm helping organize a LARP game of Scion 2e and I've come across a few things that I feel may have been clarified elsewhere, or I might be working off a previous errata, but here goes:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Several Boons mention a &quot;Ranged Attack&quot; or a &quot;Ranged Pull&quot;.<ul><li>[Ignite the Flame (Fire Purview - Origin), Blinding Veil (Darkness Purview - Hero), Arrows to the Wind (Sky Purview - Hero), Changing Tides (Water Purview - Hero), Overgrowth (Wild Purview - Hero)]</li> <li>Based on the fact that these are attacks, I assume they'll fall under the Firearms skill as that is the ranged attack skill under the Red Theme (Combat). I could also see Occult being used for these, as Boons could fall under the White Theme (Magic), but I was wondering if there had been any official clarification or if anyone had experience with these systems and found that a certain interpretation fit the best.</li> </ul></li> <li>The <b>Unobtrusive</b> Knack (Universal Knacks, pg 42 of the LARP book) grants the character an illusion that allows them to appear human.<ul><li>While this is obviously meant for Denizens that might otherwise attract attention (centaurs, mermaids, etc), since a Pre-Visitation Scion can take it, does it grant a human (or human-enough) character an illusion to appear as a <i>different</i> human? I could see the benefit to a famous character (like Donnie Rhodes) who may want to be low-key for a bit, or to a sneaky character who may not want to appear as themselves currently.</li> </ul></li> </ol>If anyone has any other thoughts or suggestions for a LARP, or knows of any rules interactions that I should be aware of, I'd welcome those thoughts too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24475-captain_hawthorne","name":"Captain_Hawthorne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}